# TD_Feedback — UI/UX Redesign Walkthrough

## 🎨 Redesign Based on TD Games Style Guide

The entire UI/UX has been redesigned to match the official **TD Games Style Guide**, including replacing the placeholder SVG logo with the actual TD Games brand logo.

