## Changes Summary

| Element | Before | After |
|---------|--------|-------|
| Primary color | Purple `#7C6AEF` | **Orange `#FF9500`** |
| Logo | SVG placeholder | **Actual TD Games logo** |
| Font | Inter | **Montserrat** |
| Background | `#111` | **`#0F0F0F`** |
| Buttons | Flat purple | **Gradient orange + glow** |
| Cards | Simple border | **Orange border + hover glow** |
| Forms | Plain inputs | **Glass effect + orange focus** |
| Animations | Basic | **fadeInUp, scaleIn, shake, pulse** |

